.DS_Store
# iCloud copies files it thinks are conflicted as "<name> 2", which no rule above matches
* [0-9]
* [0-9][0-9]
# With an extension the number goes before the dot ("index 2.vue"), which the two rules
# above miss. iCloud numbers from 2, so " 1.<ext>" names ("figure 1.png") stay committable;
# a genuine "report 2.md" would need `git add -f`. No tracked file has a space in its name.
* [2-9].*
* [0-9][0-9].*
